# Language Handling Rules Template

Use this document to define how the AI system should handle language detection, translation, terminology preservation, multilingual retrieval, user-facing responses, and workflow-sensitive meaning.

Language handling should not be left entirely to model defaults when language affects routing, eligibility, service quality, permissions, user understanding, or structured outputs.

